  HorizontalAlignment: Left
  MeshShadowMode: None
  ShadowColor: {x: 1.000000, y: 1.000000, z: 1.000000, w: 1.000000}
  ShadowDensity: 1.000000
  Text: |-
    Friend Finder helps you find a friend in a crowd, watch your back, or video-call a friend, with an iPhone companion doing the phone-side work.
    Pick the modes and the GPS source on the start menu, then press Start.
    Live calls, locations and checkpoints need the iPhone app, your own Snap Cloud project and a Specs device.
